    <title>
        Wiki algorithm rewrite, ladder-free docs and tests
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-11T23:11:11Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323373735?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>mansourvery-hub</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/mansourvery-hub</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Wiki algorithm rewrite, ladder-free docs and tests

WIKI.md rewritten from first principles (no ladder framing, detailed score equations, kana=known rule, worked 不公平 example with real definitions). Test renamed test_ladder_early_exit_order -&amp;gt; test_order_independent_argmax. Suites 611/611 + 98/98.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
