    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/mansourvery-hub/CompreDef/commit/8b69d293ec9c26df9f117cb77885e3788b42e284"/>
    <title>
        Dictionary picker audit: density scoring, picker module, strict fixtu…
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-11T21:53:47Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323373735?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>mansourvery-hub</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/mansourvery-hub</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Dictionary picker audit: density scoring, picker module, strict fixture test

v1.3 picking: length-normalized comprehension density replaces raw-sum argmax (succinct 90%-known beats 20-paragraph 5%-known). New self-contained picker.py (gather/filter/strategies/rank/pick, DensityPicker default + LegacySumPicker for A/B); engine delegates. Strict Ring 1 audit over the real 11-note deck fixture (2 sources x 3 profiles) + debug/audit_picker.py capture/report tooling + human HTML report. Docs: ARCHITECTURE equations, WIKI rewrite, QUALITY/TEST_STRATEGY maps, T12/T13. Suites 611/611 + 98/98.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
